              "originalRevision": 1,
              "originalSha256": "83a9419559e12b991f0d109ddc8c7ef477d10681060372ed81bdf838dc9d72f6",
              "excerpt": "世宗貞惠皇后劉氏，將家女也，幼歸於世宗。"
            },
            {
              "chapterId": "new-v20",
              "paragraphId": "new-v20-p6",
              "originalRevision": 1,
              "originalSha256": "0e3d83d25e5424c07b539a666fa724ce7e5be37d342829176c8e7cafb0c24b26",
              "excerpt": "貞惠皇后劉氏，不知其世家，蓋微時所娶也，世宗為左監門衞將軍，得封彭城縣君。"
            }
          ],
          "label": "家世记法不同",
          "sourceDate": "婚年未详"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "zhou-chai-rong-empress-liu-pengcheng-county-title",
      "title": "获封彭城县君",
      "summary": "汉乾祐中，柴荣任左监门卫将军时，刘氏始获封彭城县君；未详独立年月。",
      "year": null,
      "sortOrder": 6,
      "precision": "range",
      "sourceDate": "汉乾祐中；世宗为左监门卫将军时",
      "phase": "uncertain",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "chapterId": "old-v121",
          "paragraphId": "old-v121-p8",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "83a9419559e12b991f0d109ddc8c7ef477d10681060372ed81bdf838dc9d72f6",
          "excerpt": "漢乾祐中，世宗在西班，後始封彭城縣君。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "new-v20",
          "paragraphId": "new-v20-p6",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "0e3d83d25e5424c07b539a666fa724ce7e5be37d342829176c8e7cafb0c24b26",
          "excerpt": "貞惠皇后劉氏，不知其世家，蓋微時所娶也，世宗為左監門衞將軍，得封彭城縣君。"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "范围保留乾祐年间跨西历的宽界，不取某月或把柴荣任职日当她受封日。"
      ],
      "yearRange": {
        "start": 948,
        "end": 951
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "zhou-chai-rong-empress-liu-stayed-in-capital",
      "title": "柴荣随郭威在外时留京",
      "summary": "柴荣随郭威在邺、魏时，刘氏留居京师邸第；具体年月未独载。",
      "year": null,
      "sortOrder": 7,
      "precision": "undated",
      "sourceDate": "世宗随太祖在邺／从太祖于魏时",
      "phase": "uncertain",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "chapterId": "old-v121",
          "paragraphId": "old-v121-p8",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "83a9419559e12b991f0d109ddc8c7ef477d10681060372ed81bdf838dc9d72f6",
          "excerpt": "世宗隨太祖在鄴，後留居邸第。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "new-v20",
          "paragraphId": "new-v20-p6",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "0e3d83d25e5424c07b539a666fa724ce7e5be37d342829176c8e7cafb0c24b26",
          "excerpt": "世宗從太祖于魏，后留京師，太祖舉兵，漢誅其族。[2]"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "zhou-chai-rong-empress-liu-killed-under-han",
      "title": "汉末与郭氏家族同遭杀害",
      "summary": "旧史明记刘氏与张贵妃及郭氏皇族同日遇祸；新史亦叙汉诛郭氏家属。具体日期不由段落叙次补定。",
      "year": null,
      "sortOrder": 8,
      "precision": "undated",
      "sourceDate": "汉末；广顺元年追封前已故",
      "phase": "uncertain",
      "evidence": [
        {
